    <p>This feature serves as a confirmation mechanism prior to accessing the management page, ensuring that only authorized managers are granted access. When attempting to access the management page without being logged in, users will be redirected to the login page to authenticate their identity and role. Once logged in, they are then allowed access to the management page <a href="index.php?pg=login"> Click here to jump to the function</a></p>
