    <p>After accessing the management page and performing necessary tasks, users can choose to logout. Upon logout, access to the management page will be restricted. Any attempt to access the management page directly via a link without proper authentication will result in redirection to the login page. This ensures that only authenticated users with valid credentials can access the management functionality <a href="index.php?pg=manage">Click here to jump to the function </a></p>
    <img src="images/logout.jpg" alt="">
